[HEADING=2]Dataset and method[/HEADING]

[LIST]
[*]20,001 users, 10,000 threads, 100,400 posts, 47 nodes (CentMinMod run: 101,134 posts, 51 nodes) — Hampel Seeder 1.0.0b11, 2-year span.
[*][ICODE]wrk -t4 -c100 -d10s[/ICODE], 2 s warm-up, loopback HTTPS against [ICODE]xf.test.local[/ICODE] (self-signed).
[*]Guest cached: [ICODE]GET /[/ICODE] no cookies, [B][ICODE]Accept-Encoding: gzip[/ICODE][/B] (the gzip cache entry; the identity page is ~106 KB and is bandwidth-bound on both platforms).
[*]Guest bypass: [ICODE]Cookie: xf_session=bench-bypass[/ICODE]. Member: fresh XenForo session cookie, [ICODE]GET /[/ICODE].
[*]Member thread: the [B]median 9-post thread (129 KB)[/B]; the first 18-post thread (191 KB) is listed separately in the caveats.
[*]Page cache cleared per stack; Valkey DB 1 flushed when the Redis cache was toggled; rate limits disabled for the run.
[*]Stack 4 cached is measured with [ICODE]ab -k -c100[/ICODE] because wrk 4.1.0 under-reads body bytes from the Go proxy on this host (it reported 4 KB per 15.6 KB response); [ICODE]ab[/ICODE] and [ICODE]oha[/ICODE] agree with curl. Stack 4 dynamic tiers use [ICODE]oha[/ICODE] for the same reason.
[/LIST]

